{"step_index":117,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T10:31:53Z","content":"In the `infra-management-system` repository, the GitLab Personal Access Token (PAT) used to interact with `gitsi.intranet.local` is stored in:\n\n* **File Path**: [`scripts/acme/gitlab_api_vault.yml`](file:///home/koby/infra-management-system/scripts/acme/gitlab_api_vault.yml)\n* **Variable Name**: `gitlab_api_token`\n\n---\n\n### Key Details & Security Architecture\n\n1. **Ansible Vault Encryption**:\n   - In accordance with the repository's security policy ([AGENTS.md](file:///home/koby/infra-management-system/AGENTS.md) and [.gitlab-ci.yml](file:///home/koby/infra-management-system/.gitlab-ci.yml)), secrets are strictly prohibited from being committed in plaintext.\n   - The token in [`scripts/acme/gitlab_api_vault.yml`](file:///home/koby/infra-management-system/scripts/acme/gitlab_api_vault.yml) is encrypted with **Ansible Vault (AES-256)** using **Vault Password ID 2** (attached in Semaphore to templates such as template `53`).\n   - Plaintext source files matching `*.SECRETS-PLAINTEXT.yml` are ignored by [.gitignore](file:///home/koby/infra-management-system/.gitignore) and do not exist in the working tree.\n\n2. **Decryption Command**:\n   To view the token locally, use the Ansible Vault password for this project:\n   ```bash\n   ansible-vault view scripts/acme/gitlab_api_vault.yml\n   ```\n\n3. **Required Scope & Permissions**:\n   - As documented in [`docs/certs-publics-semaphore.md`](file:///home/koby/infra-management-system/docs/certs-publics-semaphore.md#L109-L113), this token requires the **`api`** scope and at least **Maintainer** permissions on GitLab project **144** (`omt/infra/management/infra-management-system`) in order to perform automated merges into the protected `main` branch.\n\n4. **Playbooks Consuming the Token**:\n   - [`playbooks/tasks/gitlab-commit-files.yml`](file:///home/koby/infra-management-system/playbooks/task